  "description": "MECZIE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H33 Cl1 Dy3 O16 3+,3(Cl1 1-),9(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.503-3.527 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.84-99.03°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy3(μ3-OH)2L3Cl2(H2O)4][Dy3(μ3-OH)2L3Cl(H2O)5]Cl5·19H2O (HL = o-vanillin). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
